  </div>
</div>

<p>Token efficiency comes from targeted private retrieval: each agent fetches only role-relevant memories instead of sifting through a global pool of all agents' histories. The per-agent similarity threshold τ filters noise early.</p>

<h3>Ablation: does online weighting matter?</h3>
<table class="results-table">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Routing policy</th><th>AgentNet avg</th><th>DyLAN avg</th><th>AutoGen avg</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td class="mn">Exploration Only (α=0)</td><td class="mn">46.8</td><td class="mn">46.7</td><td class="mn">47.3</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="mn">Fixed Weight (α=0.5)</td><td class="mn">48.2</td><td class="mn">48.6</td><td class="mn">50.6</td></tr>
