<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Consequence over time:</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Task 1: Planner writes "decompose into sub-tasks"</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Task 2: Coder reads it → also decomposes</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Task 5: all agents write similar strategies</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Task 20: pool dominated by one strategy</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># → agents behave identically (homogenized)</span>
<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Also: communication overhead, privacy risk,</span>
